WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:04.920
Summer of the 24th year of Yuankang Prince of Jin captured Dongming defeated the imperial army.

00:05.320 --> 00:10.120
News reached the capital officials were shocked the court was shaken.

00:14.800 --> 00:19.600
The people are most important the state comes second the ruler is least.

00:20.240 --> 00:21.640
Princess Consort.

00:22.360 --> 00:27.160
Princess Consort when I went out just now I heard news His Highness has taken Dongming.

00:30.240 --> 00:33.133
Mother is Father coming back to get us?

00:35.920 --> 00:36.680
Yes.

00:36.760 --> 00:38.120
Father is coming back.

00:38.800 --> 00:40.720
What did Mother teach you before?

00:40.800 --> 00:42.280
Listen to Father.

00:43.280 --> 00:46.000
Father has great things to do don't cause Father trouble.

00:47.880 --> 00:49.240
Sheng'er is good.

00:52.500 --> 00:59.500
Just as you breached Dongming and prepared to point your blades toward the capital, an unexpected guest arrived at your military camp.

00:59.580 --> 01:02.500
Both armies remained locked in standoff for over a month. Heavy snow blocked the mountain passes, freezing the war in stalemate until the spring thaw could determine victor and vanquished.

01:05.280 --> 01:10.760
Today I come on behalf of His Majesty this is an edict personally written by His Majesty.

01:10.840 --> 01:14.600
The edict speaks of two things first.

01:14.680 --> 01:19.800
The treacherous chancellor Chen Dao has corrupted the court His Majesty now understands the truth.

01:20.240 --> 01:23.947
Wishes to remove the treacherous chancellor and execute the corrupt officials.

01:25.200 --> 01:30.720
Second His Majesty deeply understands all of you present today are all heroes of the northern expedition.

01:30.800 --> 01:35.720
Not rebels His Majesty will not only not punish but will heavily reward you all.

01:35.800 --> 01:40.600
Hopes you will do your utmost to recover the homeland soon.

01:40.800 --> 01:46.600
The court will reward us the court will reward us the court will reward us wonderful.

01:46.680 --> 01:48.080
Wonderful.

01:50.480 --> 01:54.480
His Majesty also has words for me to bring to Your Highness.

01:55.120 --> 02:00.280
A family has come to this state what kind of situation is this?

02:04.240 --> 02:09.480
Tell the second son to withdraw to the north send his family.

02:10.400 --> 02:12.320
All to him.

02:13.840 --> 02:16.560
This life can't be lived together.

02:17.280 --> 02:22.320
Then live apart after crossing the river he may raise.

02:22.760 --> 02:24.440
The imperial banner.

02:26.080 --> 02:27.680
North of Tianhe.

02:29.120 --> 02:31.160
All will be under his rule.

02:36.240 --> 02:38.960
Your Highness accept the edict.

